  "details": "# Issue:\n\nWhen exporting your camera paths currently you only get the information from the path nodes, but the Motion Control, Path Type, Looping, Easing and Streaming Settings are not.\n\nThis makes it a bit more difficult to save and share paths with others, as besides the path JSON they also need to know what settings you used.\n\n# Suggestion:\n\nWhen exporting and importing paths, the the Motion Control, Path Type, Looping, Easing and Streaming Settings should all also be exported / imported to make sharing and saving them easier.",
